    "overview": "<p>The Free Worlds League's fractious politics have always made centralized BattleMech procurement difficult, pushing the FWLM toward heavy investment in conventional infantry to fill the gaps. Deploying Thumper cannon, a direct-fire variant of the standard Thumper artillery piece, these platoons sacrifice the indirect fire arc for improved accuracy against visible targets, filling a niche between heavy field guns and true artillery.</p>"
